TestNG -  Testing Next Generation
    --> Testing framework inspired by JUnit

Selenium Webdriver --> Interact with the browser

Annotations --> pre-defined tags used in Java which control the test execution flow, manage test cycles. configure test steps. Elimimate  `main` method.

Orders:

@BeforeClass--->@BeforeSuite -->@BeforeTest-->@BeforeClass-->@BeforeMethod()--->@Test()--->@AfterMethod--->@AfterClass-->@AfterTest-->@AfterSuite

Assertion :
    --> Used to verify whether the actual result matches the expected results.
    --> Assertion Types:
        --> Hard Assertion
        --> Soft Assertion

FEATURE         |       HARD ASSERTION      |           SOFT ASSERTION

class                   Assert                              SoftAssert
Package                 org.testng.Assert                   org.testng.Asserts.SoftAssert
Failure Behavior        Stops current test immediately      Test continues
Multiple Validation     Stops at first failure              can execute remaining validations
Assertall()             Not required                        required
Best for                Critical validation                 Multiple independent validation
